  "details": "Instance owner creates instance and defines moderator list.\n\nUsers request off mods/owner to join the instance (as normal).\n\nonce accepted the user is automatically added to the temporary group.\n\nOne use case of this would be to have a small private event where you're not sure who will want to come by, but don't want to just leave the doors wide open.\n\nAnd it has the same format as joining any Group instance but users don't have to join a group long term because the group is removed when the instance is removed.\n\nIts analogous to any club where you have someone work the door.",
